        "evidence": "Opening line 'The stability of the macroscopic spacetime continuum is equivalent to the Riemann hypothesis.' asserted flatly, and clause (3) presented as an equivalent of RH.",
        "notes": "STRUCTURAL, do not fix inline - the finding is in the Lean sibling macroscopic-stability-equivalence.lean and it is serious. (a) The whole 'theorem' is two axiom applications: 'theorem macroscopic_stability_equivalence ... := <macroscopic_iff_rh psi zeta, rh_iff_persistence zeta spectral_limit>', where both components unfold to 'axiom macroscopic_iff_rh_axiom' and 'axiom rh_iff_persistence_axiom'. Nothing is derived (AGENTS.md 'Axiomatization is NOT a Proof' / 'Never launder ... through Lean axioms'). (b) 'axiom rh_iff_persistence_axiom' is captioned '**External axiom (Weil 1948 explicit formula)**', but Weil 1948 proves the Riemann hypothesis for curves over finite fields; it does not relate the classical RH to this framework's spectral persistence. The citation key weil1948 does resolve in references.ts, so this is a mis-attribution of content, not a dangling key. (c) 'def SpectralPersistence (spectral_limit) : Prop := (forall n i, spectral_limit n i = 1/2) -> forall i, spectral_limit 0 i = 1/2' is a TAUTOLOGY - instantiating the hypothesis at n = 0 IS the conclusion, so it is inhabited by 'fun h i => h 0 i' for every spectral_limit. Clause (3) therefore asserts nothing. (d) Consequently the axioms are INCONSISTENT as written: both quantify their arguments independently, so 'rh_iff_persistence_axiom zeta f : RiemannHypothesis zeta <-> SpectralPersistence f' combined with (c) yields 'RiemannHypothesis zeta' for EVERY zeta : C -> C; taking zeta = (fun _ => 0) and s = 1/4 (0 < 1/4 < 1, zeta s = 0, s.re != 1/2) refutes the local definition 'RiemannHypothesis zeta := forall s, 0 < s.re -> s.re < 1 -> zeta s = 0 -> s.re = 1/2', so False is derivable. The same independent quantification makes macroscopic_iff_rh_axiom absurd on its own. Blast radius is contained: I grepped and no other .lean imports this file. Proposed: state (3) with a real hypothesis relating the pre-limit and post-limit spectra, tie psi, zeta and spectral_limit to one another in the axiom signatures, and demote the block per AGENTS.md 3b since clause (3) is conjectural."
